==Behind the scenes==
The concept of the base on Polis Massa coming to be used by the Rebel Alliance was [[Raid on Polis Massa|first seen]] in [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] through the ''[[Star Wars: Battlefront II]]'' video game.<ref name="BF2">''[[Star Wars: Battlefront II]]''</ref>

